          "text": "Emotional and work-related experiences"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports feeling over it, more tearful driving home, snappy with partner and colleagues, and more cynical at work. Still enjoys partner, dog, and TV when not exhausted; not going out much socially. Reports making more little mistakes at work and double-checking medications more."
      }
